verified share 15% -> 6%; failed runs 9 -> 7; lessons needed 15 -> 12; 0 adopted
lessons carried, 10 injected
caveat: Task B is built from the same three slices Task A's held-out gate scores
lessons on, so B1 vs B0 measures whether gate-selected lessons help a long task 
on those features, not transfer to unseen work.
caveat: Small n: 3 subtasks x swarm-size runs per phase; a difference of one run
is noise. Report counts next to shares.
caveat: run_task stops at the first subtask that does not verify; compare 
subtasks_done and per-subtask shares only for subtasks both phases attempted.
caveat: B1 also carries Task A's trust scores (vote weights, winner choice); 
rerun b1 with --b1-no-trust to isolate lessons.
